   'deep',
   '{"summary":"Never assign untrusted data to innerHTML; use textContent or a strict sanitizer.","steps":["Replace innerHTML assignments with textContent or DOMPurify-sanitized HTML.","Host DomGoat-style labs on isolated subdomains, not production apps.","Audit all DOM sinks (innerHTML, document.write, eval) in client bundles."]}'::jsonb,
   'Our site hosts DomGoat-style DOM XSS exercises with innerHTML sinks on /cxss routes. Show safe textContent alternatives and how to isolate the lab from production traffic.',
   true),
  ('client-side-invicti-practice-site-evidence', 'generic', 'Injection', 'medium',
   'Invicti/Netsparker practice site documents SQLi, XSS, and LFI targets',
   'Invicti Test Web Site pages advertise sql-injection, XSS, and file-inclusion practice endpoints including hidden phpinfo and nslookup forms.',
